Cell["\<\
Figure 5.1  Annual displacement of the monthly population centroid along each \
species' primary flyway: common swift (Afro-Palearctic) \[TildeTilde] 14,000 \
km, red knot (Americas) \[TildeTilde] 7,900 km, Arctic tern (Atlantic basin) \
\[TildeTilde] 24,100 km. The deliberately broken global red-knot track is \
excluded.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"b72ac7a5-1ecc-42b4-81e6-289c522f84a9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Crucial caveat \[LongDash] read before quoting these numbers. ",
  FontWeight->Bold,
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "This is the displacement of the population ",
 StyleBox["centre of mass",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", NOT how far any individual bird flies. The two differ enormously, and in \
both directions. For the Arctic tern the centroid figure ",
 StyleBox["understates",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " the journey: because the species is nearly circumpolar, east\[Dash]west \
motion in different longitudes cancels in the mean, so the centroid mostly \
captures the north\[Dash]south sweep. Tracked individual Arctic terns average \
about ",
 StyleBox["70,900 km per year",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " (Egevang et al. 2010) \[LongDash] roughly three times the ~24,100 km \
centroid displacement. The centroid is a population statistic; the geolocator \
figure is an individual's odometer. Do not conflate them."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{4, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellMargins->{{60, 60}, {6, 10}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.85, 0.6, 0.15],
 Background->RGBColor[
  1., 0.97, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"ff6c9ac0-6298-4bcf-9a41-0d1a95b09bef"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5.1  From one point to a flock", "Subsection",
 FontFamily->"Roboto Condensed",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0.153, 0.51, 0.64],ExpressionUUID->"467615d4-52cf-4210-8271-f501eed10a2d"],

Cell["\<\
A centroid is one point; the population is millions of birds. The same twelve \
monthly positions, resampled along great circles and seeded with a flock, \
turn the journey into motion \[LongDash] not to add new information, but to \
make the seasonal sweep legible at a glance:\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"df3ea2ee-72ef-4383-8a01-0658a6308419"],

