Cell["\<\
Figure 8.1  Magnetic inclination (dip angle) across the globe, with the three \
population-centroid tracks overlaid. Dip runs from \[Minus]90\[Degree] at the \
south magnetic pole through 0\[Degree] at the magnetic equator to \
+90\[Degree] at the north magnetic pole; the contours run almost \
east\[Dash]west, nearly parallel to geographic latitude.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
 FontSlant->Italic,
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.35],ExpressionUUID->"b00cd050-d0d5-42ce-a3ba-87f5442e962e"],

