 "Figure 9b.1  Arctic tern \[LongDash] recent eBird sightings (last 30 days, \
as of late June 2026), swept across a spread of countries. ",
 StyleBox["Source: eBird.org (Cornell Lab of Ornithology)",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "."
}], "Text",
